<title>USA: Dentsply buys firm's assets for C$20.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Dentsply buys firm's assets for C$20.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>YORK, Pa. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dentsply International Inc, a dental products maker and distributor, said Tuesday it had bought dental assets of Efos Corp, a Toronto-based company, for $20.7 million cash.</p>
<p>Dentsply said the acquisition will increase its margins with the addition of manufacturing profit formerly earned by Efos on sales of C$8.0 million to Dentsply.</p>
<p>The acquisition will add about US$3.5 million to Dentsply's annual sales, it said.</p>
</text>
